From 30551044ebed5bdad536939ee23d6dc0419ce33f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kossay20 <loeymot@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 12:20:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] design(wave-4): V2-2 POC drag-drop + V2-5 Phase 2 themes
 + V2-3+V2-4 integration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Triple-feature wave shipping greenfield POC + admin tooling +
frontend integration. Frozen-zones intact. Default flags conservative.

V2-2 — Phase A POC drag-drop (greenfield)
- KioskBurgerBuilder.vue, KioskBurgerLayer.vue, KioskBurgerBuilderPoc.vue
- Standalone POC route /kiosk/burger-builder-poc (admin-toggle)
- vue-draggable-next default-slot pattern (lib v2.3.0 doesn't support #item)
- 10 vitest specs green — drag/keyboard alternative/a11y
- Frozen wizards 8/8 untouched

V2-5 — Phase 2 themes activation
- KioskThemeManagerPage.vue + KioskThemePreviewCard.vue admin UI
- bootstrap-kiosk.js : 4 themes CSS imports + initialize() boot hook
- BUG FIX kioskThemeManager.js : URL '/api/admin/...' -> 'admin/...'
  axios baseURL is /api so previous code produced /api/api/... 404
- 15 vitest specs green + 2 corrected for new URL pattern

V2-3 — Admin upsell preview tool
- UpsellPreviewController POST /api/admin/upsell-preview (read-only)
- 7 PHPUnit Feature tests (auth + branch_id + strategy match)
- UpsellPreviewPage.vue 394 LOC + route module
- Defense-in-depth: explicit match() instead of dynamic class injection

V2-4 — Voice ordering on idle (additif, opt-in OFF default)
- KioskVoiceOrderingDialog.vue 185 LOC pre-flight confirmation
- KioskIdleScreenComponent : voice CTA + dialog + handlers (additive only)
- Locale -> Web Speech API lang mapping (fr-FR/en-US/ar-SA)
- Default isVoiceFeatureEnabled=false for safe rollout
- voice_intent query param to wizard (frozen-friendly)
- 6 vitest specs green

i18n
- kiosk.builder.* (10 keys FR+EN)
- kiosk.admin.upsell_preview_* (12 keys) merged in existing block
- kiosk.admin.theme_manager_* (10 keys) merged in existing block
- kiosk.voice.dialog_* (4 keys) extending existing voice block

Tests cumulative
- 46/46 vitest on touched specs green
- 7/7 PHPUnit on UpsellPreviewControllerTest green
- Frozen-zones grep guard: 0 violation (8 wizards + agent files intact)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
